Package: remotr-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Remotr contributors
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6, libgtk-3-0 | libgtk-3-0t64, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/DavidHoenisch/remotr
Description: Native Linux fleet administration for Remotr
 Remotr Desktop is a native operator workspace for inspecting and
 administering Remotr-managed Linux fleets through the authenticated Admin API.
